# Gold data never enters git — see CLAUDE.md.
# DVC pointers (`*.dvc`) and this .gitignore DO — see the root
# .gitignore for the recursive exclusion pattern that also allows
# nested subdirectories to hold committable pointers.
#
# This file intentionally holds no ignore rules so nested .dvc pointer
# files at any depth remain re-includable. Its only job is to keep
# `data/gold/` present in a fresh clone.
